@@ -87,6 +87,14 @@ Vision channel:
 - Vision payloads are not added by the automatic LLM request hook. JSON and
   images become visible to the model only after it explicitly calls the vision
   buffer tools.
+- The `set_astrbotex_vision_marks` LLM tool sends `vision.mark.set` over the
+  text channel to the EX peer that published the requested `stream_id`. First
+  read the JSON buffer for exact object IDs, then call it with
+  `{"stream_id":"...","ids":["id1","id2"],"marked":true}`. Set
+  `marked=false` to clear selected IDs. `request_id` is optional, but reuse the
+  same value when retrying an uncertain request. EX acknowledges only after
+  persisting the atomic update; other marks remain unchanged. The command
+  annotates detections and never issues motion control.
 
 ## Installation
 
